  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 取值范围",
    "title": "若互不相等的单位空间向量 $\\overrightarrow{OP_i}\\ (i=1,2,3,4)$ 满足 $|P_1P_2|=|P_2P_3|=|P_3P_4|=|P_4P_1|=1$，则 $|P_1P_3|^{2}+|P_2P_4|^{2}$ 的取值范围是",
    "answerLabel": "$|P_1P_3|^{2}+|P_2P_4|^{2}$ 的取值范围",
    "answerValue": "$(3,4]$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "化成单位向量的内积",
      "content": "<p>$|\\overrightarrow{OP_i}|=1$，且相邻弦长为 $1$，故</p>$$|P_iP_{i+1}|^{2}=2-2\\,\\overrightarrow{OP_i}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{OP_{i+1}}=1\\implies \\overrightarrow{OP_i}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{OP_{i+1}}=\\dfrac{1}{2}.$$<p>记 $p=\\overrightarrow{OP_1}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{OP_3}$，$q=\\overrightarrow{OP_2}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{OP_4}$，则</p>$$|P_1P_3|^{2}+|P_2P_4|^{2}=4-2(p+q).$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Sphere_unit",
        "Point_P1",
        "Point_P2",
        "Point_P3",
        "Point_P4",
        "Line_P1P2"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.95,
        "y": 3.8,
        "z": 4.13
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Gram 矩阵半正定且秩 $\\le 3$",
      "content": "<p>四个单位向量的 Gram 矩阵主对角为 $1$，相邻为 $\\dfrac{1}{2}$，对角为 $p,q$。它必须半正定且行列式为 $0$（四向量在三维空间）。</p><p>$\\det G=0$ 给出 $(p-1)(q-1)(pq+p+q)=0$。向量互不相等排除 $p=1$ 或 $q=1$，故</p>$$q=-\\dfrac{p}{p+1}.$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_P1",
        "Point_P2",
        "Point_P3",
        "Point_P4",
        "Line_P1P3",
        "Line_P2P4"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.7,
        "y": 4.9,
        "z": 3.17
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形：取到上端 $4$",
      "content": "<p>$3\\times 3$ 主子式非负推出 $p,q\\in\\left[-\\dfrac{1}{2},1\\right)$。再代 $q=-\\dfrac{p}{p+1}$，得 $p\\in\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{2},1\\right)$，从而</p>$$4-2(p+q)=4-\\dfrac{2p^{2}}{p+1}.$$<p>$p=q=0$ 时取到 $4$。图中实线球面菱形 $P_1P_2P_3P_4$ 对角互相垂直，就是这一款。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Line_P1P3",
        "Line_P2P4",
        "Point_P1",
        "Point_P2",
        "Point_P3",
        "Point_P4",
        "Sphere_unit"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 5.41,
        "y": 3.48,
        "z": 3.88
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "情形：逼近下端 $3$",
      "content": "<p>当 $p\\to 1^{-}$ 或 $p\\to-\\dfrac{1}{2}^{+}$ 时，$4-\\dfrac{2p^{2}}{p+1}\\to 3$，但取不到（向量互不相等）。图中虚线 $Q_1Q_2Q_3Q_4$ 取 $p=\\dfrac{3}{4}$，目标值为 $\\dfrac{47}{14}$，已经明显比实线菱形更扁。</p><p>因此 $|P_1P_3|^{2}+|P_2P_4|^{2}$ 的取值范围是 $(3,4]$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Line_Q1Q3",
        "Line_Q2Q4",
        "Point_Q1",
        "Point_Q2",
        "Point_Q3",
        "Point_Q4",
        "Sphere_unit"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.7,
        "y": 4.9,
        "z": 3.17
      }
    }
  ],
